---
/**
 * CursorPreload
 * Warms the custom cursor images (see @/styles/global.css) so the first hover
 * shows the jellyfish/trident instead of briefly falling back to the system
 * cursor while the PNG is still being fetched. Belongs in <head>.
 */
---

<link rel="preload" as="image" href="/images/cursors/jellyfish-32.png" />
<link rel="preload" as="image" href="/images/cursors/jellyfish-64.png" />
<link rel="preload" as="image" href="/images/cursors/trident-32.png" />
<link rel="preload" as="image" href="/images/cursors/trident-64.png" />
